{
  "pack": {
    "pack_format": 15,
    "description": "SkyTekx3 content fixes. Overrides that neutralise broken third-party data files (FFB thermal-cultivation seeds, Create galosphere silver compat recipes, galosphere trim advancement) to silence boot-time parse spam. It also turns off the ores of Railcraft and Immersive Engineering that duplicate the preferred ores of Almost Unified, so each metal has one ore. It also makes the Hexbiscus of Hexxit Gear generate as one single flower in 1 of 32 chunks, without the clusters of the mod. It also places the hollow oak logs of Hexxit Additions on the forest floor in about one of ten forest chunks. It also lets the Tinkers' Construct smeltery melt the horse armor and gloves of other mods, and no piece melts into more metal than its recipe takes. It also makes the Auto Executor of Extra Utilities Reborn Again craftable, which the mod ships without a recipe. It also turns the five old decoration blocks of the Chocolate Quest Builder Village into the normal blocks, in new villages and in what they drop."
  }
}
